## Hub dependency

QuickTrack Hub `main` already sends `x-hub-user-email` and `x-hub-user-role` (PR #11). After HR RBAC merges, assistant calls **require** those headers (403 without them). API-key-only scripts will stop working — intentional.

## Will merges break the pilot?

**No** for SSO, login, dashboard, time clock, schedule. RBAC touches **`/api/internal/assistant/*` only**.

## Before you commit (assistant paths)

- `app/api/internal/assistant/*`, `lib/internal-assistant/*`
- Enforce tier: `admin` / `manager` (store-scoped) / `employee` (self-only)
- Read `docs/HR-DATA-ACCESS-CAPABILITY-MAP.md`
- Never log emails, PTO, or full rosters in `[HR][INTERNAL_ASSISTANT]` logs
- Never commit `.env` / secrets

